# do not delete me
#
# Git tracks files, not directories, so this directory would vanish from
# the next clone without a file in it. This is that file. It ignores
# nothing on purpose — see `keepMarker` in schemas/cat-harness.ts.
#
# uploads/
# The incoming queue of the document-ingestion pipeline — raw files as
# dropped, before ingestion. NOT L1 and NOT greppable as corpus: the corpus
# checklist searches library/ only, so a source still sitting here reads as
# absent to every consumer while the file is on disk. That is why it is a
# separate declaration from library/ rather than the same directory under
# two names.
